WEBVTT

00:12.120 --> 00:13.130
It's over.

00:13.620 --> 00:15.250
Tatsuya, you've worked hard.

00:15.570 --> 00:17.010
What about the abducted woman?

00:17.390 --> 00:18.600
It seems to be okay.

00:18.860 --> 00:19.790
That's great.

00:20.310 --> 00:23.640
But, on the pretext
of not participating in anti-magician work,

00:23.730 --> 00:27.100
to kidnap the daughter of the TV station's CEO,

00:27.190 --> 00:29.320
it's too far-fetched.

00:30.950 --> 00:33.370
Lieutenant, please wait for a moment.

00:43.240 --> 00:44.100
It's over.

00:44.450 --> 00:45.580
What happened?

00:45.900 --> 00:49.520
A special detachment of the criminal
was targeting us on the airship.

00:49.880 --> 00:51.740
Since the airship has been erased,

00:51.800 --> 00:55.060
please remove the record data
for using magic later.

00:55.730 --> 00:56.850
I see.

01:02.480 --> 01:04.470
Okay, I see.

01:06.230 --> 01:09.540
Wiping out all their men with the airship...

01:09.780 --> 01:11.240
It's disgusting.

01:11.520 --> 01:13.770
Is that guy again?

01:16.300 --> 01:18.030
Maheshvara!

01:19.940 --> 01:23.940
It seems necessary to find out the true identity.

01:37.790 --> 01:42.070
(The Irregular at Magic High School S3
Double Seven Arc)

02:57.240 --> 02:57.990
(April 25, AD 2096)

02:57.990 --> 02:59.340
(April 25, AD 2096)
About yesterday's Stella Reactor experiment,

02:59.340 --> 03:00.560
About yesterday's Stella Reactor experiment,

03:00.700 --> 03:03.640
(The President of the Japanese
Branch of Rosen Magicraft, Ernst Rosen)
I didn't expect high school students to be able to

03:03.640 --> 03:05.470
(The President of the Japanese
Branch of Rosen Magicraft, Ernst Rosen)
manipulate such advanced magic techniques.

03:05.970 --> 03:07.970
I was surprised
at the high level of technology in Japan.

03:07.980 --> 03:09.950
Damn it, Saegusa...

03:19.100 --> 03:21.790
Well done, Saegusa.

03:22.470 --> 03:23.540
What?

03:23.730 --> 03:26.090
About yesterday's public experiment.

03:26.320 --> 03:30.110
Isn't it amazing
that it was widely reported on the news?

03:30.530 --> 03:33.290
Shippou, are you not mistaken for something?

03:33.300 --> 03:34.510
Don't play dumb.

03:34.920 --> 03:37.280
You knew that a congressman who's against

03:37.280 --> 03:39.420
a magician was coming and planned it, didn't you?

03:39.620 --> 03:41.300
Take advantage of Senior Shiba,

03:41.320 --> 03:43.250
and promote your family cleverly.

03:43.320 --> 03:45.370
Don't make strange accusations.

03:45.930 --> 03:47.400
I was too careless.

03:47.500 --> 03:50.000
He's a bit of a celebrity.

03:50.220 --> 03:52.930
As expected it's Saegusa, you're clever.

03:53.380 --> 03:56.040
You wanna treat him
with a trick like your sister?

03:56.070 --> 03:59.430
You sisters are first-class at first sight.

03:59.440 --> 04:00.590
Don't mess with me!

04:01.730 --> 04:05.520
We Saegusa can't even think about it.

04:05.950 --> 04:09.600
Shippou, your ideas are too vulgar.

04:10.730 --> 04:13.160
Are you fighting with me, Saegusa?

04:13.680 --> 04:17.400
It's you who started the fight first, Shippou.

04:18.000 --> 04:20.400
And didn't I tell you?

04:20.420 --> 04:25.170
I'll beat you down so hard
that you won't want to fight again.

04:25.210 --> 04:26.120
Hum!

04:29.740 --> 04:30.760
You two there!

04:31.240 --> 04:32.660
Put your hands down!

04:36.650 --> 04:37.620
I won!

04:43.130 --> 04:44.970
That was Drawless!

04:45.500 --> 04:50.130
Without overtaking CAD,
an advanced technique to release magic

04:50.160 --> 04:52.390
by aiming only the senses
while putting it in the holster.

04:53.100 --> 04:56.470
Senior students can do such a feat.

04:56.850 --> 04:59.000
I still have to work hard.

04:59.520 --> 05:00.900
- Kasumi.
-Ah!

05:10.720 --> 05:13.990
Hattori, how do you think this should be handled?

05:14.180 --> 05:16.410
Shippou is a member of the Club Management Group.

05:16.460 --> 05:19.420
I don't have the confidence
to make a fair judgment.

05:19.440 --> 05:23.030
If you say that, Kasumi is a member of
the Public Morals Committee.

05:23.380 --> 05:26.030
What do you,
the student council, think as a third party?

05:26.490 --> 05:28.330
Although Shippou was attempted,

05:28.340 --> 05:31.040
I heard that it was in CAD operation.

05:31.330 --> 05:33.270
The worst case is probably dropout.

05:33.570 --> 05:34.600
Compared to that,

05:34.600 --> 05:37.190
I think that Kasumi
whose attempted level is less guilty.

05:38.290 --> 05:40.450
So, the punishment of Shippou is dropout?

05:40.580 --> 05:41.230
No,

05:41.610 --> 05:44.030
if asking the cause of the matter,

05:44.030 --> 05:45.680
just punishing them will not erase their grudge.

05:45.810 --> 05:47.990
Why don't we just let them have a game?

05:48.610 --> 05:51.720
Unauthorized use of magic
is a serious violation,

05:51.800 --> 05:54.540
but there is no need
to punish students who attempt it.

05:54.980 --> 05:57.370
- It happens all the time for new students.
- Em...

05:57.680 --> 06:00.080
- Em...
- If each other's pride is at stake,

06:00.100 --> 06:04.870
I think that it would help solve it
once and for all with their abilities.

06:05.300 --> 06:07.630
If you allow me to play against Saegusa,

06:07.650 --> 06:08.840
I have a request.

06:09.490 --> 06:10.560
Try saying it.

06:10.810 --> 06:12.580
Please let me play against

06:12.590 --> 06:14.590
both Saegusa Kasumi and Saegusa Izumi.

06:14.660 --> 06:17.670
You, are you making fun of me?

06:17.980 --> 06:18.870
Why?

06:19.170 --> 06:22.530
This is a game that shows the pride
of the Shippou family and the Saegusa family.

06:22.660 --> 06:27.330
In addition, it is a well-known story

06:27.340 --> 06:28.820
that "the Saegusa twins show their true value
only when they are together".

06:29.210 --> 06:33.940
So if you don't play against them two
at the same time, it can't say you really win?

06:34.240 --> 06:35.400
That's right.

06:35.730 --> 06:37.920
Shippou said that, so Kasumi you?

06:38.100 --> 06:41.790
No problem! I will make him regret his arrogance.

06:42.530 --> 06:44.210
Well, let's do that.

06:45.240 --> 06:48.180
(The Second Workshop, the First High School)

06:58.640 --> 07:01.000
This game is played under no-touch rules.

07:02.000 --> 07:04.250
It is forbidden to touch the other person's body.

07:04.560 --> 07:06.500
Touching with a weapon will also be disqualified.

07:07.440 --> 07:08.240
However.

07:09.190 --> 07:12.290
Weapons controlled remotely
by magic are not a violation.

07:12.770 --> 07:15.170
Finally, attacks that cause fatal

07:15.210 --> 07:17.930
or incurable injuries are prohibited.

07:18.530 --> 07:23.490
- If it is judged to be dangerous, we will
forcibly cancel the game. Please keep that in mind
- Ah... Em...

07:24.560 --> 07:26.770
Okay, both sides, ready.

07:35.370 --> 07:36.260
Start!

07:41.720 --> 07:42.780
- What do you think?
- Ah.

07:43.550 --> 07:45.850
So far, they're evenly matched.

07:48.360 --> 07:49.500
So...

07:53.900 --> 07:55.890
If they go on like this, it is not going to help.

07:57.270 --> 07:58.220
Oh no!

08:05.610 --> 08:06.520
That's...

08:21.830 --> 08:22.790
Now!

08:26.640 --> 08:28.660
Kasumi, are you all right?

08:29.170 --> 08:31.940
Thanks, it was dangerous just now.

08:32.200 --> 08:34.220
Izumi, that, let's do it.

08:34.510 --> 08:37.440
Okay, Kasumi. As always.

08:37.700 --> 08:39.080
I shoot.

08:39.190 --> 08:40.800
I boost.

08:41.090 --> 08:43.460
Well, let's go. Countdown.

08:43.620 --> 08:44.480
Three.

08:44.550 --> 08:45.250
Two.

08:45.490 --> 08:46.270
One.

08:46.420 --> 08:47.500
Cast!

08:51.520 --> 08:54.300
The wind is mainly composed of nitrogen.

08:54.820 --> 08:58.420
Is it the magic that incapacitates
the opponent with hypoxia,

08:58.740 --> 09:00.490
Nitrogen Storm?

09:00.520 --> 09:01.360
Yes.

09:01.470 --> 09:04.490
To be able to use such high-level magic,

09:04.790 --> 09:08.140
they'd be worthy of Senior Saegusa's relatives.

09:08.430 --> 09:11.830
It doesn't work well, but it's still a big deal.

09:12.960 --> 09:15.160
This is a multiplicative cast...

09:16.050 --> 09:21.730
It's said that "the Saegusa twins show
their true value only when they are together".

09:23.580 --> 09:24.900
Hum...

09:33.830 --> 09:36.020
Go, Million Edge!

09:39.050 --> 09:40.620
Heat Storm!

09:52.460 --> 09:53.600
End there!

10:02.400 --> 10:04.950
In this game, both sides failed.

10:05.050 --> 10:06.660
What do you mean?

10:07.000 --> 10:08.690
I told you before the game.

10:09.090 --> 10:11.920
If we think it's dangerous, we'll stop the game.

10:12.450 --> 10:15.380
Nitrogen Storm is unlike Million Edge.

10:15.400 --> 10:19.510
It's neither a lethal magic
nor a magic with after-effects.

10:19.620 --> 10:23.610
Certainly, Nitrogen Storm doesn't
leave any aftereffects on your opponent

10:23.610 --> 10:25.780
by controlling its power.

10:26.130 --> 10:29.920
But Izumi, just now
you should not have that spare time.

10:31.580 --> 10:32.830
Wait, please!

10:32.930 --> 10:36.220
The magic of Saegusa
could not stop my Million Edge!

10:36.610 --> 10:38.880
Are you trying to tell me you won?

10:39.060 --> 10:39.960
Yes!

10:40.100 --> 10:43.540
Before Nitrogen Storm broke my airtight shield,

10:43.560 --> 10:46.150
my attack should have reached Saegusa!

10:46.460 --> 10:48.710
That is to say, if I hadn't stopped it,

10:48.880 --> 10:53.220
a million pieces of burning paper
would have done it to the two.

10:53.270 --> 10:54.570
Do you mean that?

10:55.870 --> 10:59.480
If so, Shippou, this game, you foul and lose it.

10:59.880 --> 11:03.370
What would happen if you put Million Edge on it,

11:03.540 --> 11:05.320
don't tell me you don't know.

11:06.130 --> 11:08.510
So, if I used Million Edge,

11:08.530 --> 11:10.940
you'd decide from the beginning
that I would lose, right?

11:11.000 --> 11:14.650
As long as the attack is not controlled,
it is foul.

11:14.650 --> 11:15.590
And, Shippou,

11:16.020 --> 11:18.820
you could not suppress that power.

11:19.120 --> 11:20.470
You're picking on me!

11:20.490 --> 11:22.890
I properly controlled the technique!

11:23.060 --> 11:25.020
I'm the referee of this game.

11:25.130 --> 11:26.770
I'll make the decision.

11:26.970 --> 11:31.280
In other words, the use of Million Edge
is an excessive attack!

11:31.310 --> 11:34.560
Then you should have told me that
from the beginning!

11:34.580 --> 11:37.730
If I knew that, there would be
other ways to fight!

11:37.750 --> 11:39.130
Don't act spoiled, Shippou.

11:39.330 --> 11:42.690
You can't control your power
because you are immature.

11:43.260 --> 11:47.440
It is only your lack of skill
that you failed to comply with the given conditions.

11:48.650 --> 11:49.910
What!?

11:50.740 --> 11:53.500
I don't want you the weed to tell me!

11:58.570 --> 12:01.100
Shippou, it's enough and stop it!

12:01.630 --> 12:03.550
Senior Tomitsuka?

12:03.580 --> 12:08.170
From what I've just heard,
it's all self-righteous, rude talk...

12:08.440 --> 12:11.280
Are you saying that the 28 Families are so great!?

12:11.710 --> 12:13.400
I... I didn't mean to.

12:13.420 --> 12:15.660
Shippou, fight me.

12:16.360 --> 12:18.030
The game is in two days.

12:18.290 --> 12:21.140
If you want to prove your power,

12:21.170 --> 12:22.720
I'll go with you!

12:23.590 --> 12:27.540
Range Zero, the failure of the Tomitsuka
of the Hundred Families will be there!

12:30.200 --> 12:31.970
(The Irregular at Magic High School S3
Double Seven Arc IV)

12:32.280 --> 12:32.870
(April 27, AD 2096)

12:32.890 --> 12:37.750
(April 27, AD 2096)
The attacks that can cause fatal
or incurable injuries are prohibited.

12:37.950 --> 12:42.080
So, there's no use restriction
about Million Edge.

12:50.310 --> 12:51.200
Start!

13:03.940 --> 13:04.620
What?

13:07.130 --> 13:08.560
Gram Demolition?

13:08.840 --> 13:12.160
Besides Tatsuya, there are people
who can use that in this school?

13:12.300 --> 13:15.800
Contact type, should be added before.

13:17.330 --> 13:19.480
Million Edge has been broken!?

13:21.740 --> 13:26.170
No, it just doesn't work
once attacking from the front!

13:54.090 --> 13:55.050
Now!

14:01.990 --> 14:03.360
It's done!

14:14.830 --> 14:15.740
It's the end then.

14:16.170 --> 14:17.560
The winner is Tomitsuka.

14:21.220 --> 14:23.360
Shippou, can you stand up?

14:23.740 --> 14:24.360
Yes.

14:24.720 --> 14:26.380
Have a rest by the wall.

14:26.720 --> 14:27.450
Okay.

14:36.330 --> 14:37.080
What?

14:37.540 --> 14:38.400
Shiba,

14:38.770 --> 14:40.590
can you play the game with me?

14:40.850 --> 14:43.710
I want you to show your ability to Shippou!

14:44.310 --> 14:46.380
I don't understand.

14:46.520 --> 14:48.440
Well, that's...

14:48.690 --> 14:53.340
Can you show Shippou the game
between the real powerful players?

14:53.470 --> 14:56.950
In that case, isn't it more suitable for the game

14:56.950 --> 14:58.660
between Vice-president Hattori and the senior?

14:58.740 --> 15:02.730
Shiba, it is meaningful to show your strength.

15:03.620 --> 15:06.610
Brother, isn't that ok?

15:06.790 --> 15:09.590
If you want to set an example
for lower-grade students,

15:09.640 --> 15:12.650
I think it is the duty of student union members.

15:13.120 --> 15:19.970
Besides, I was also hoping
that brother you would show your strength soon.

15:21.660 --> 15:24.000
If you say so.

15:30.720 --> 15:32.570
Are you two ready?

15:36.970 --> 15:37.820
Start!

15:40.970 --> 15:42.400
Mist Dispersion!?

15:44.940 --> 15:46.770
So it will be invalidated?

15:48.100 --> 15:52.030
Tomitsuka's body is covered in thick scion armor.

16:08.960 --> 16:11.510
Using the discontinued
event modification as a stepping stone,

16:11.570 --> 16:14.080
to activate a new acceleration magic!?

16:14.100 --> 16:15.890
Can he do that??

16:20.220 --> 16:24.640
I didn't think there was a classmate
who could match Tatsuya's fighting ability...

16:30.060 --> 16:31.430
I can't attack!

16:31.600 --> 16:34.900
I expected it, but it's not like this...

16:36.070 --> 16:37.530
But I won't lose.

16:37.650 --> 16:40.120
I can't lose at this distance!

16:51.210 --> 16:52.250
Brother!

16:55.170 --> 16:57.840
Oh, you were blown away by yourself!

16:58.200 --> 17:01.090
To surpass the Self Marionnett of Tomitsuka.

17:01.560 --> 17:03.210
Shiba, do it!

17:03.780 --> 17:05.950
Tomitsuka's surprisingly good.

17:06.040 --> 17:09.280
That bastard aimed at bro Shiba's eardrum.

17:58.920 --> 18:00.420
The winner is Shiba.

18:06.090 --> 18:07.030
Tomitsuka.

18:07.890 --> 18:08.960
Thank you.

18:10.760 --> 18:14.010
As I thought, you're strong, Shiba.

18:14.090 --> 18:16.760
You too, Tomitsuka. That worked pretty well.

18:18.250 --> 18:19.380
Huh!

18:22.010 --> 18:23.600
Hey, Shippou!

18:24.680 --> 18:25.620
Damn!

18:26.140 --> 18:27.090
Damn!

18:27.520 --> 18:28.920
Damn!!

18:29.230 --> 18:30.160
Damn!

18:30.550 --> 18:31.700
Damn!

18:32.120 --> 18:34.020
Stop it, Shippou.

18:37.350 --> 18:39.030
You're bleeding.

18:39.410 --> 18:40.600
Saegusa, you...

18:40.620 --> 18:42.890
Oh, don't get me wrong.

18:42.930 --> 18:45.960
It's a complete coincidence that I'm here.

18:46.440 --> 18:47.450
What!?

18:47.500 --> 18:50.880
Ah! You're hurt so badly.

18:51.660 --> 18:53.280
It's okay with this.

18:54.520 --> 18:56.920
You have to go to the health room.

18:59.890 --> 19:02.540
Looks like you lost quite a bit.

19:03.830 --> 19:07.260
It's sure enough, the seniors are super strong.

19:07.940 --> 19:08.770
Why?

19:09.250 --> 19:10.650
Eh, what?

19:11.010 --> 19:14.250
Why are they so strong?!

19:15.240 --> 19:17.170
We're both high school students, right?

19:17.310 --> 19:19.700
It's only one year different!

19:19.740 --> 19:23.510
Why are they so strong?!

19:24.930 --> 19:26.750
There's no reason, is there?

19:26.810 --> 19:27.440
What?

19:27.450 --> 19:29.930
Because they're strong, they must be strong.

19:30.170 --> 19:35.580
I see. If you want to find a reason, it is
because they have worked hard to become strong?

19:36.440 --> 19:37.410
Me too!

19:37.920 --> 19:38.570
Yeah.

19:39.060 --> 19:41.310
I'm sure you've worked hard too.

19:41.650 --> 19:43.840
I'm trying, too.

19:44.600 --> 19:48.080
But isn't it because of their hard work

19:48.140 --> 19:51.410
that they're stronger?

19:51.950 --> 19:53.750
You don't deny their talent, do you?

19:53.960 --> 19:59.240
I also think
that my ability is largely due to my talent.

19:59.990 --> 20:03.780
But the "strength" that shocked you

20:04.140 --> 20:07.970
might come from somewhere else, not just talent?

20:22.650 --> 20:27.270
Well, I'm not really interested in strength.

20:27.620 --> 20:29.910
If you want to be strong,

20:29.920 --> 20:31.650
that is your problem.

20:31.900 --> 20:35.860
Shippou, the strength of you is only yours.

20:45.000 --> 20:46.400
Damn...

22:14.290 --> 22:18.990
Tatsuya's evaluation
seems to be a little too high...

22:19.920 --> 22:24.250
I think I understand
what Hayama you're concerned about.

22:24.630 --> 22:28.750
It is true that the child
might betray Yotsuba anytime.

22:29.070 --> 22:30.560
I'm afraid so.

22:30.840 --> 22:35.720
My Meteor Line is suppressed
by his supernatural abilities.

22:36.420 --> 22:40.320
If I fight seriously,
there is a high probability that I will lose.

22:40.760 --> 22:44.290
But even if Tatsuya can betray Yotsuba,

22:44.320 --> 22:46.550
he can't betray Miyuki.

22:46.850 --> 22:51.070
And Miyuki will never be hostile to Yotsuba.

22:51.760 --> 22:56.420
Miyuki can never escape her responsibility.

22:56.900 --> 23:00.000
Because my sister raised her that way.

23:00.100 --> 23:05.090
And Tatsuya also can't do anything
to make Miyuki suffer.

23:05.840 --> 23:07.990
But in order to do that...

23:08.440 --> 23:08.940
Yeah...

23:09.350 --> 23:12.000
I'm sorry for the children
of the other candidates,

23:12.050 --> 23:14.410
but the next head of the family will be Miyuki.

23:15.360 --> 23:20.010
In order not to turn Tatsuya,
that monster, into an enemy.

23:20.550 --> 23:26.000
Miyuki must accept the position
of the head of the family at any rate.

23:26.480 --> 23:28.920
Don't worry, Hayama.

23:29.060 --> 23:32.900
And for that, I also have a plan.

23:36.520 --> 23:40.250
(The Irregular at Magic High School S3
Steeplechase Arc I)
